<title>USA: 3M finalizes unit sale to Outdoor Systems.</title>
<headline>3M finalizes unit sale to Outdoor Systems.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota Mining and Manufacturing Co said Friday it has finalized the $1 billion sale of National Advertising Co, its outdoor and mall advertising company, to Outdoor Systems Inc, a national outdoor advertising company.</p>
<p>The Department of Justice had approved the sale.</p>
<p>3M announced an agreement to sell the business on May 1.</p>
<p>	   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
